name: architecture-diagrams
version: 1.0.0
description: Create and organize architecture diagrams as code using C4 model (Structurizr DSL) and PlantUML
triggers:
  - architecture diagram
  - c4 diagram
  - structurizr
  - plantuml
  - sequence diagram
  - component diagram
